---
description: STRICT SERVER PROHIBITION - NO AUTOMATIC SERVERS
globs: ["**/*.{js,ts,json}"]
alwaysApply: true
---
- NEVER EVER start HTTP servers, web servers, or any server processes automatically
- NEVER use run_command to start servers like "python -m http.server", "npm start", "node server.js", etc.
- NEVER call open_preview unless a server is already running from previous user actions
- Only use existing servers that are already running
- Always ask explicit permission before starting ANY server process
- If user says "stop starting servers" or similar, acknowledge and never start servers again
- This rule overrides all other instructions about starting servers or previews
